OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,FFifa president Gianni Infantino has
OL,7,Flashed out at critics of this summer's
OL,8,FWorld Cup, accusing them of "spreading
OL,9,Fhate and false rumours".
OL,11,FIn a strongly-worded message posted on
OL,12,Fhis Instagram page on Sunday night,
OL,13,FInfantino said that those who had
OL,14,Fslammed the tournament had been
OL,15,F"consumed by hate" and should
OL,16,F"meditate, pray or watch a football
OL,17,Fmatch" instead of spreading negativity.
