OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FDefending Fifa's handling of the World
OL,12,FCup, Infantino insisted that the
OL,13,Ftournament had showcased "humanity at
OL,14,Fits best".
