OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1785682092
OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,F"To all of you who missed watching
OL,7,Fkids, babies, grandparents, and
OL,8,Fparents come together for the
OL,9,Fbeautiful game, I say sorry that the
OL,10,Fmatches are now over and sorry that
OL,11,Fyou missed all that joy and
OL,12,Ftogetherness," he wrote.
OL,14,F"Sorry that you were so consumed by
OL,15,Fhate and criticism that you missed it
OL,16,Fall.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
