OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1785682092
OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,F"To those behind their pens and
OL,7,Fpapers, behind their screens spreading
OL,8,Fhate and false rumours, I want to say
OL,9,Fthat while you are sitting behind, we
OL,10,Fat Fifa are on the front lines
OL,11,Forganising, working hard, and
OL,12,Fdelivering the best show in the world."
OL,14,FThe Fifa chief had come under fire
OL,15,Fafter several off-field controversies
OL,16,Fwhich had threatened to overshadow the
OL,17,Ftournament.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
