OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1785682092
OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,FFans from Iran, Senegal, Haiti and the
OL,7,FIvory Coast had to contend with travel
OL,8,Frestrictions imposed by the US
OL,9,Fgovernment, while Somali referee Omar
OL,10,FArtan was barred from entering the
OL,11,Fcountry.
OL,13,FResponding to that criticism,
OL,14,FInfantino said: "You mentioned the few
OL,15,Fpeople denied visas and overlooked the
OL,16,Fmillions who were approved, from all
OL,17,Fparts of the world. Because football
OL,18,Funites the world, and it was
OL,19,Fdemonstrated impressively this summer."
