OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,FInfantino also defended Fifa's
OL,7,Fdisciplinary decisions ` most notably
OL,8,Fthe controversial call to overturn a
OL,9,Fred card shown to USA's star striker
OL,10,FFolarin Balogun following an
OL,11,Fintervention by President Donald Trump.
OL,13,FTrump admitted that he had called
OL,14,FInfantino in the wake of Balogun's
OL,15,Fdismissal in the last-32 tie against
OL,16,FBosnia and Herzegovina and asked him
OL,17,Fto take a second look.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
