OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1785682092
OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,FAppearing to play down the incident,
OL,7,FInfantino wrote that similar rulings
OL,8,Fare "routine and widely accepted in
OL,9,Fsome of the biggest leagues worldwide".
OL,11,F"It's curious that the same countries
OL,12,Femploying these practices are the ones
OL,13,Fcriticising," he added.
OL,15,FInfantino's post also claimed that the
OL,16,Ftournament experienced "no violence,
OL,17,Fno incidents, 100% safety and
OL,18,Fsecurity, only joy and happiness," and
OL,19,Fthanked host nations Canada, Mexico,
OL,20,Fand the United States for delivering
OL,21,F"the most outstanding Fifa World Cup."
OL,26,@uD@MO]xD@XOUzD@bO]}D@AOU}D@fO]
