OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1785682092
OL,3,CInfantino accuses World Cup critics of
OL,4,C'spreading hate' in social media rant
OL,6,F"Our world needs love, not hate;
OL,7,Ftolerance, not division; celebration,
OL,8,Fnot mourning," he said.
OL,10,F"I am incredibly proud, as Fifa
OL,11,Fpresident, to have contributed, even a
OL,12,Flittle, to this show. It's a great
OL,13,Ffeeling."
